{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/government/publications/community-infrastructure-levy-charges-on-householders-letter-to-local-authorities","content_id":"6a843c7a-0928-4717-9968-d0b5a394c868","description":"Letter from Matthew Pennycook MP, Minister of State for Housing and Planning, to all leaders and chief executives of Community Infrastructure Levy charging authorities in England.","details":{"attachments":[{"accessible":false,"alternative_format_contact_email":"alternativeformats@communities.gov.uk","assets":[{"asset_manager_id":"6a3ceb0333bc5beefd3c49ab","filename":"260625_MHCLG_letter_-_Community_Infrastructure_Levy___Household_Developer_Exemptions.pdf"}],"attachment_type":"file","command_paper_number":"","content_type":"application/pdf","file_size":197313,"filename":"260625_MHCLG_letter_-_Community_Infrastructure_Levy___Household_Developer_Exemptions.pdf","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9360115","isbn":"","number_of_pages":3,"title":"Community Infrastructure Levy charges on householders: letter to local authorities​","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a3ceb0333bc5beefd3c49ab/260625_MHCLG_letter_-_Community_Infrastructure_Levy___Household_Developer_Exemptions.pdf"},{"attachment_type":"html","command_paper_number":"","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9360132","isbn":"","title":"Community Infrastructure Levy charges on householders: letter to local authorities​ (accessible)","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"/government/publications/community-infrastructure-levy-charges-on-householders-letter-to-local-authorities/community-infrastructure-levy-charges-on-householders-letter-to-local-authorities-accessible"}],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><p>This letter was sent on 25 June 2026 to all leaders and chief executives of the 164 local authorities in England that charge and collect the Community Infrastructure Levy (CIL).</p>\n\n<p>The letter concerns CIL exemptions for:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>householder developers building large residential extensions or residential annexes</li>\n  <li>self builders building, or commissioning the building of, their own homes</li>\n</ul>\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-06-25T11:03:04Z"}],"document_type_label":"Correspondence","emphasised_organisations":["1390d07f-12b3-4f55-9dd5-fec5fd9e3649"],"featured_attachments":["9360115","9360132"],"first_public_at":"2026-06-25T12:03:04.000+01:00","national_applicability":{"england":{"applicable":true,"label":"England"},"northern_ireland":{"alternative_url":"","applicable":false,"label":"Northern Ireland"},"scotland":{"alternative_url":"","applicable":false,"label":"Scotland"},"wales":{"alternative_url":"","applicable":false,"label":"Wales"}},"political":true,"tags":{"browse_pages":[]}},"document_type":"correspondence","first_published_at":"2026-06-25T12:03:04+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/publications/community-infrastructure-levy-charges-on-householders-letter-to-local-authorities","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/publications/community-infrastructure-levy-charges-on-householders-letter-to-local-authorities","base_path":"/government/publications/community-infrastructure-levy-charges-on-householders-letter-to-local-authorities","content_id":"6a843c7a-0928-4717-9968-d0b5a394c868","document_type":"correspondence","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-06-25T11:03:04Z","schema_name":"publication","title":"​​Community Infrastructure Levy charges on householders: letter to local authorities​","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/community-infrastructure-levy-charges-on-householders-letter-to-local-authorities","withdrawn":false}],"children":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/publications/community-infrastructure-levy-charges-on-householders-letter-to-local-auth